OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over death of
OL,4,A79-year-old at bus stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for causing the
OL,7,Fdeath of a pensioner he pushed over
OL,8,Fduring an argument at a bus stop
OL,9,Foutside a supermarket in Leeds.
OL,11,FThomas Childe, 24, of Oak Crescent,
OL,12,FGarforth, was sentenced to six years
OL,13,Fand eight months in prison at Leeds
OL,14,FCrown Court on Friday after admitting
OL,15,Fmanslaughter.
OL,17,FColin Starbuck, 79, had a heart attack
OL,18,Fand died after the incident outside the
OL,19,FTesco store on Aberford Road, Garforth,
OL,20,Fon 29 October 2025. Police concluded
OL,21,Fthe confrontation had contributed to
OL,22,Fhis death.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
