OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over death of
OL,4,A79-year-old at bus stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FChilde was arrested after officers
OL,7,Fidentified him from CCTV footage and
OL,8,Fwas initially charged with murder. He
OL,9,Flater pleaded guilty to manslaughter.
